   304→    description: |
   305→      SvelteKit-based web interface for viewing and editing specs, tasks, inbox, and session state.
   306→      Uses shadcn-svelte components for accessible UI. Connects to daemon via REST API and WebSocket
   307→      for real-time updates. Includes WebSocketManager for connection resilience with exponential
   308→      backoff reconnection and sequence deduplication.
   309→    depends_on:
   310→      - "@api-contract"
