   318→    created: 2026-01-22T01:18:11.366Z
   319→    acceptance_criteria:
   320→      - id: ac-1
   321→        given: daemon is running and browser opens localhost:3456
   322→        when: page loads
   323→        then: dashboard shows task overview with ready, in_progress, pending_review, blocked, completed
   324→          counts
   325→      - id: ac-2
   326→        given: dashboard is displayed
   327→        when: task counts update on server
   328→        then: counts animate to new values without page refresh (WebSocket-driven)
   329→      - id: ac-3
   330→        given: dashboard is displayed
   331→        when: user clicks a task count badge
   332→        then: navigates to task list filtered by that status
   333→      - id: ac-4
   334→        given: user is viewing task list
   335→        when: list loads
   336→        then: shows task title, status badge, priority indicator, spec_ref link, notes count
   337→      - id: ac-5
   338→        given: user is viewing task list
   339→        when: clicking a task row
   340→        then: task detail panel opens showing description, notes (chronological), todos, dependencies
   341→      - id: ac-6
   342→        given: user is viewing task detail
   343→        when: task has spec_ref
   344→        then: spec reference is clickable link to spec item detail
   345→      - id: ac-7
   346→        given: user is viewing task detail
   347→        when: user clicks Start Task button
   348→        then: POST to /api/tasks/:ref/start, task status updates, UI reflects change
   349→      - id: ac-8
