   379→        when: AC row expands
   380→        then: shows full Given/When/Then text with test coverage indicator if available
   381→      - id: ac-16
   382→        given: user navigates to /inbox
   383→        when: inbox list displays
   384→        then: shows items ordered by created_at desc with text preview, tags, added_by
   385→      - id: ac-17
