   465→    description: >
   466→      Static site generation from kspec state for hosting read-only views on GitHub Pages.
   467→
   468→      CI workflow builds JSON snapshot from shadow branch on push, SPA reads this JSON for
   469→      rendering.
   470→
   471→      Enables deep linking to tasks/specs from PRs and issues with data freshness indicator.
